input.description:
Apply the constraint one or two sketch entities nearly have already: horizontal or vertical
for one line; for two, coincident, point on curve, collinear, parallel, perpendicular, equal,
concentric or tangent, whichever the geometry is closest to.

line.description:
The symmetry line's id, or `x` / `y` for the sketch's own axis (a curve with that id wins;
an axis becomes a linked construction line, reported in `created`). A point's id (or
`origin`) instead makes the symmetry about that point. Read when `point` is not given.
